signer-cert.der, python-signtype1.der and python-reply.txt are copied unchanged
from the Swakshar project (fixtures/reference at commit f87f2f8,
https://github.com/swakshar-app/swakshar), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

They are a throwaway test certificate (holder "SWAKSHAR TEST SIGNER", issuer
"Swakshar Test CA 2026", PAN ABCDE1234F), a GST portal signature made with it
over the content "ABCDE1234F" at 2026-09-25T00:00:00Z, and the reply frame
sent to the portal. The keys existed only in memory, so the files can sign
nothing. TrackMySign's tests rebuild the signature and the reply from the same
inputs and require identical bytes.
